	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Clean Invisible Text

Reviews and cleans dangerous invisible Unicode characters locally, using
the pinned go-clean-invisible-text CLI. Unicode detection/cleaning rules
live only in that CLI; this Workflow never reimplements them.

Usage:
* Type the "cit" keyword to act on the clipboard.
* Select text anywhere, invoke Universal Actions, and choose "Clean
  Invisible Text" to act on the selection (see this project's README.md
  for the one-time setup step this needs).

Then pick Check, Reveal, or Clean. Press Enter on a result to copy a
report (⌘+Enter includes the original text); on a Clean result in the
Warning state, ⇧+Enter re-runs keeping unclassified characters.</string>
